## 5. Path A - automated deployment

Run terraform init, plan and apply from the infra directory after copying the
terraform.tfvars example. Bootstrap takes 6-10 minutes.

## 6. Path B - manual AWS Console

Create the VPC with two public and two private subnets and no NAT gateway, then
the two security groups, then the RDS instance, then the EC2 instance, then the
Elastic IP, then install the stack over SSH.

## 7. Why these choices

EC2 plus RDS keeps the database off the application host; the private subnet
keeps it off the internet; Ubuntu 22.04 is required because PrestaShop 8.2.9
caps PHP at 8.1.
